    notes: "Four MCX commodity futures (gold, silver, copper, crude oil) with dated-contract daily history, intraday quotes, comparator venues, news, release calendar vintages, macro vintages, positioning, FX and session calendars, to the close of Fri 25 Sep 2026 (USD/INR to Fri 18 Sep); every row carries its availability clock. Licensed to registered teams for use in Commodity Open 2026 only; no sharing or redistribution until the verdicts are sent."
